{"id":"639860","name":"南瓜饼","author":"红•宏","authorId":"10737312","desc":"","cover":"images/639860/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"南瓜","amount":"一块"}],"sub":[{"name":"无糖饼干","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材，忘记放白芝麻了。","img":"images/639860/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"南瓜去皮去瓤洗干净切成薄片。","img":"images/639860/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"上锅蒸熟。","img":"images/639860/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒸熟的南瓜放白糖压成泥。","img":"images/639860/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加糯米粉。","img":"images/639860/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/639860/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"团成大小均匀的的圆。","img":"images/639860/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"压扁。","img":"images/639860/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"用两个饼干夹起来。","img":"images/639860/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"裹上白芝麻。","img":"images/639860/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"做成的半成品。","img":"images/639860/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"锅中倒油，油温六成热将南瓜饼放进去小火慢炸，炸至飘起捞出。","img":"images/639860/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"酥脆软糯，香甜可口。","img":"images/639860/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/639860/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"再来一张。","img":"images/639860/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"炸南瓜饼全程用小火，大火饼干会变糊发苦。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}